\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Jesus Christ stands in heaven's way
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 to receive we poor sinners.
\par Let us make a move to meet him
\par Christ our Saviour Lord and King!
\par The peace we shall all receive
\par In His Glory shall be great.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Jesus have prepared a good place
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For His children and all friends;
\par So we shall strive hard to look for
\par the true way to His Kingdom.
\par That's the place our Jesus stays:
\par \pard     Jesus Christ is the Great name.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\ulnone\b0 
\par  \cf0 3.  Jesus is the way and the life
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  It behoves on every one.
\par  Holy Spirit, soul and body
\par is for Christ he gave to us.
\par Let all creatures of the world
\par Listen to his good news now.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

